<title>USA: U S West seeks stay of Oregon refund order.</title>
<headline>U S West seeks stay of Oregon refund order.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD, Colo. 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>U S West Communications said Tuesday that it has filed a motion for stay of the Oregon Public Utility Commission's May 19, 1997 order to refund $102 million to customers.</p>
<p>The company noted that last Friday it appealed aspects of the same ruling that would reduce prices by $97 million, effective back to May 1, 1996.</p>
</text>
